          "note": "The wall's own material, finished in mud plaster -- the cladding and the structure are the same substance."
        },
        {
          "id": "stucco",
          "status": "forbidden",
          "note": "Own hard constraint c04: cement stucco on historic adobe traps moisture at the interface and destroys the wall from within -- a preservation failure as well as a stylistic one. Only mud plaster or lime wash is permitted."
        }
      ],
